  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aing'ae otiu anaa oltung'ani ng'en? Naa aing'ae oyiolo ina kibelekenyata entoki pooki? Ore eng'eno nagut e tung'ani neitawang enkomom enye, ore ina golon enkomom enye neibelekenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toning'o olaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbung'a enkitanapata o laiguanani, naa ore enkaraki olmumai sinyati miureishoyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shomo tung'uai enkomom enye; mimutie eton mesidai esiaai amu eas ninye ina nayieu pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ilo rorei lo laiguanani naa sapuk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa aing'ae oidim atiaki ninye, “Kaa doi iasita iyie?” Ore ilo oyanyit enkitanapata nemetum enkitamioto, naa ore ina damunoto oltung'ani ng'en neyiolo e nkata neyiolo enkoitoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore pooki bae neeta erishata enye o enkoitoi enye, hoo naa ore enyamali oltung'ani naa keyek ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu meyiolo ninye ina nayooki aaku, anaa aing'ae oidim atoliki ninye enayooki aaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae oltung'ani oota engolon naibokie enkiyang'et, arashu eeta engolon naitoreyie ina olong e keeya; olarrabal ilo limikiilany, nemeitajeu intorrok lelo oishooki ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilarruok o supati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atoduaa kuna pooki ina kata apikita endamunoto ai nena pooki naasi tiabori enkolong, enkop naata kulikae engolon, neitorogony ilkulikae ootii abori ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadol lelo tung'ana torrok enukari; lelo apa oojing nepuku aaing'uaa ewueji sinyati, neisisi tiatua enkanasa teine netaasie imbaa naaijo nena. Ore sii ninye ena naa empesho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu medung'okini ina torroni enkiguana aasioki, ore oltau le nena kera oo ltung'ana netudung'o pee eas entorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore hoo neas olaing'okoni entorroni katitin iip nabo neitoodor enkishui enye, kake ayiolo ake ajo kesidanu oleng te lelo ooure Enkai, amu keureisho te dukuya ninye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake mesidanu te lelo arruok, nemeitoodor inkolong'i enyena anaa oloip, amu meeta enkuretisho te dukuya Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii empesho naasi te nkop, etii iltung'ana supati laa ninche eitaasi nena siaitin naaipiru lelo torrok, netii iltung'ana torrok laa ninche eipang'aki iyasat naas lelo supati. Atejo sii ore ena naa empesho sii ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyorraa nanu enkitumurrunoto, amu meeta tung'ani toki sidai tiabori enkolong kake pee edaa, neokisho neshipakino kewan, amu eiriamariyie ena eekenyata enye tiatua nena olong'i e nkishui naisho Enkai ninye tiabori enkolong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee apik endamunoto ai aitayiolo kewan eng'eno nagut, nadol esiaai naasitae tioriong enkop, nadol ajo metum oltung'ani injo dama arashu kewarie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nadol teine isiaaitin pooki e Nkai, inchere meyiolou oltung'ani ina siaai naasi tiabori enkolong. O tenaa keturu oleng oltung'ani aekenya eing'oru, metum hoo ninye pito; hoo nenya kutuk oltung'ani ng'en ajo eyiolo. Metum hoo ninye pito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
